  "id": "psychosomatic",
  "term": "psychosomatic",
  "definition": "Psychosomatic refers to an approach in medicine and mental health that recognizes the mind and body as closely connected, though not the same, in clinical care. It describes a field positioned between bodily medicine and psychiatry that focuses on this mind-body unity.",
